{"objects":[{"id":"flow","instance":"instance--b96dad5f-c519-5a1f-a718-912ca4a86c02","objects":["attack-action--1","attack-action--2","attack-action--3","attack-action--4","attack-action--5","attack-action--6","attack-action--7","attack-action--8","attack-action--9","attack-action--10","attack-action--11","attack-condition--1","attack-condition--2","attack-condition--3","attack-operator--1","instance--9c9218eb-f4ef-5688-bae1-8832f0bf575e","instance--7ff2ac04-8381-5dc4-a1cf-bada897a55e3","instance--b238e638-881f-5404-bd7c-5bb735b93d56","instance--b5c5fbb8-1e3f-5cf0-b245-2c82762cdfd3","instance--4dbd120e-940b-595d-95b4-8a84b686eeb4","instance--030060d9-a79f-5c6d-b1ed-2495fff7b83d","file--1","process--1","instance--becc7795-37fe-5653-834c-15b423ef23c9","instance--c257710f-8ced-5238-a5a8-3050488cd8fc","instance--cd8e2e12-554c-5e0b-9908-bf5d0aaae299","instance--0c317ec5-0a0a-5c51-9800-801de2acf6d3","software--2","instance--551e16de-e80f-5197-ad05-322d2874079d","instance--fc3abb54-a200-5986-93df-62f0ff68c1af","software--4","software--5","instance--2b8046e7-e362-5f83-a4e1-1c665f93c78c","instance--64ef185e-e8ce-5579-8eec-1e09b86f02a5","instance--9b678836-644d-5c0f-a172-b2624b498cd1","instance--b05ec101-c9e8-5f5f-9ccd-fe95076ad857","instance--ed5c599f-d7c2-51d3-a851-1b41fa6ef17e","instance--f02204d6-4ece-5339-83ba-cc984b7645a3","software--6","software--7","software--8","file--2","instance--ad1f125b-7701-5e9d-b869-79f40471648d","instance--dba76cba-ac10-53fc-8651-9c93dbcacdf3","instance--ed6039fe-678b-5ae9-9576-73e6ea35b0c8","instance--7e8c9301-c3f8-55e9-8894-e81f1b6203d9","instance--d8c1ac68-9d53-5126-80b0-7decc34c9563","instance--048bde3a-ae79-5902-b1ae-a81e12509c33","instance--3fe2f14a-3053-58b3-a9f2-4b0402c04433","instance--373ab17f-52d8-5a48-a78d-02df1204eda3","instance--2c5305bd-750a-5f5c-8327-e89b27fa76a1","instance--5cd5881d-97c5-5e6f-9fe5-7b1dfb542b6e","instance--fa898d2b-d4ff-5f35-95bd-4affc7070bef","instance--ee3191b1-92da-5bf9-9c78-97dea82b6c31","instance--4f599b63-f24a-5e75-abce-5defdac13489","instance--e3aa313f-c213-5ab5-8a8f-e6582b5a88a9","instance--be99ba49-e121-58a8-ba7b-dd3de316cfcf","instance--ffbe8170-954c-5236-8efc-95e531bf82b5","instance--56da8838-1109-5fce-9d89-7b3ec32d7010","instance--714f6cb9-bdb0-5e83-914a-3c8158d9f2de","instance--ff500f2b-8509-53c9-8817-4272d937543c","instance--e28c61d0-be08-595d-b694-80935ffe4433","instance--aaed1ef6-6978-5a66-983b-51be56c74b70","instance--e7ff83c4-c2b5-5db0-b953-761ea46af0b4","instance--9d3f89be-694d-59a0-8244-5b93d5250ad4","instance--d67df2e3-f239-5084-b92d-d2446dc8f121","instance--665d5822-5d6d-56d6-a1c2-4b0b4a1d0b77","instance--399a759f-97f7-528c-90c7-de3363f46907","instance--08c824b0-cc91-5677-8b90-fd03b46c5f19","instance--497b1824-4717-52ce-8be1-bbece7dc77e6","instance--fa371a37-a523-5ea4-a031-be56a47d5c9c","instance--19577037-d1bb-51aa-8591-cc667352e000","instance--c30c76fd-9ea2-5690-adb6-09a7091654ed","instance--b9749028-c9a4-5f86-bfb9-ea0cf55e48fb","instance--614adce4-c8e7-5057-838d-7de6f2396fe9","instance--f6b04134-407e-5b9b-8cb1-e08d26b129df","instance--199bfe59-7d63-51a0-816f-e7733d86fc74","instance--dc65906c-5087-5f16-ab1e-0cc6b9d742de","instance--68e48a1a-3276-5570-9ca0-f8e7995a8885","instance--56cb3fe0-7290-5994-bec0-880e54084dbe","instance--38d38c3c-9a4f-5941-921d-3d5bffb73928","instance--2b711834-bf74-52e7-9660-a150de46e6f8","instance--c663a015-c314-5a83-bb8e-eeeb5cecf515","instance--9ffec466-29ee-5a09-85c7-3fd434d9333f"],"properties":[["name","Operation AkaiRyu - Central European diplomatic institute compromise"],["description","In August 2024, ESET researchers detected cyberespionage activity carried out by the China-aligned MirrorFace advanced persistent threat (APT) group against a Central European diplomatic institute in relation to Expo 2025, which will be held in Osaka, Japan."],["scope","incident"],["author",[["name","ESET Research"]]],["external_references",[["item-1",[["source_name","www.welivesecurity.com"],["url","https://www.welivesecurity.com/en/eset-research/operation-akairyu-mirrorface-invites-europe-expo-2025-revives-anel-backdoor/"]]]]]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ad592d05-6969-5b51-98a8-1ad9b6aab896","120":"instance--5850a8f4-8241-5e73-9bf0-dcd376cd5025","150":"instance--0da1498f-3beb-5916-a249-e0410a4a81e4","180":"instance--d3632784-7391-5a29-83e2-edab51db56c6","210":"instance--8bc47ca5-ca73-5a04-a9ea-918608f10871","240":"instance--6546eef6-c5ad-516e-a417-89916e651648","270":"instance--244e5a69-f465-564e-9d2c-93d4da44fc57","30":"instance--6a1fca3c-fdb6-536a-bbea-61ac2349a700","300":"instance--043a5b44-2864-5565-abce-1909204e5485","330":"instance--e10eb918-2b0b-56f4-9c82-f345ce21276c","60":"instance--33a99d1b-dad8-51f6-be74-e1614db9151b","90":"instance--380c79e9-b1eb-547c-bf01-a011db1201c1"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Send initial spearphishing email"],["description","MirrorFace operators set up their spearphishing attack by crafting an email message (shown in Figure 2) that references a previous, legitimate interaction between the institute and a Japanese NGO. The legitimate interaction was probably obtained from a previous campaign. As can be seen, this spearphishing set up message refers to the upcoming exhibition, an event that will be held in Japan."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1566.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Send malicious OneDrive link"],["description","This first email was harmless, but once the target responded, MirrorFace operators sent an email message with a malicious OneDrive link leading to a ZIP archive with a LNK file disguised as a Word document named . This second message is shown in Figure 3. Using this approach, MirrorFace concealed the payload until the target was engaged in the spearphishing scheme."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1566.002"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Run LNK with PowerShell"],["description","Once opened, the LNK file launches a complex compromise chain, depicted in Figure 4 and Figure 5.\n\nThe LNK file runs with a set of PowerShell commands to drop additional files, including a malicious Word file, , which loads a malicious Word template, , containing VBA code. The contents of the Word document are depicted in Figure 6, and probably are intended to act as a decoy, while malicious actions are running in the background."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1059.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Execute VBA from malicious template"],["description","The VBA code extracts a legitimately signed application from JustSystems Corporation to side-load and decrypt the ANEL backdoor (version 5.5.5). This gave MirrorFace a foothold to begin post-compromise operations."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1204.002"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a469636c-0cb2-50b9-92f9-644c8aa98197","120":"instance--d57b3a21-e910-5879-8148-40165cea451a","150":"instance--58250ef4-5bb4-5bf3-b33e-89493bbb395d","180":"instance--3e769cf2-c1e5-5d2e-81d4-892f48ce4d86","210":"instance--f6499e41-749c-5d7f-9346-96c08d0d5dfd","240":"instance--d9dcdfc8-5f42-546a-803a-0efcd5d4cf91","270":"instance--c9afd0f6-97ce-57b2-9d60-3557b6214809","30":"instance--75f82155-f5ff-5619-8bf8-aae22937cab0","300":"instance--25e2d26e-1b35-56bd-b9aa-096c2d3b0e3c","330":"instance--e0483688-da10-5376-8cf2-050bcc3b70f0","60":"instance--1293d9cc-16b2-5c67-a453-bd144aab133a","90":"instance--2b43cd52-10db-5b15-8ad5-c4b59496528b"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--5","properties":[["name","Side-load and decrypt ANEL"],["description","The VBA code extracts a legitimately signed application from JustSystems Corporation to side-load and decrypt the ANEL backdoor (version 5.5.5). This gave MirrorFace a foothold to begin post-compromise operations."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1574.002"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--54fc1f38-f4e3-523e-b07c-73889b0d8df7","120":"instance--9cf45948-7040-5d7a-a1d5-3cb4db0c1af6","150":"instance--13bb13cc-e02b-51d2-8d7d-40e5613b6e5a","180":"instance--e33bc6ee-771e-54fe-a772-74dfdaad420d","210":"instance--286f51a3-8fc6-55ec-978e-8b05ebda3655","240":"instance--14659696-be77-5460-beb1-4b5eac126e43","270":"instance--f48ed1a6-2895-5cd2-9b1c-e30ac2bc8921","30":"instance--7b803e61-16ac-5720-92cd-8f2a456a52b7","300":"instance--76c24361-5143-5c43-8e4d-707c619e6038","330":"instance--f395cfc7-395a-5001-9552-a4fec6dbc53a","60":"instance--760885bb-9294-5a5b-93a2-a410e1ea4112","90":"instance--8e0d1a12-8611-598d-9a7d-40f2525e4781"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--6","properties":[["name","Deploy PuTTY VS Code HiddenFace and Hidden Start"],["description","The next day, MirrorFace returned and continued with its activities. The group deployed several tools for access, control, and file delivery on both compromised machines. Among the tools deployed were PuTTY, VS Code, and HiddenFace \u2013 MirrorFace\u2019s current flagship backdoor. On , MirrorFace also attempted to deploy the tool Hidden Start."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1105"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--7cccbcd0-a724-54fb-be4f-ac523d26f7d0","120":"instance--738e44b2-1357-5eb3-82bd-8a0ce8942b72","150":"instance--d31f4735-6339-5929-8d7c-d30863cf166f","180":"instance--2252393d-d801-5931-ad38-4b53374a9880","210":"instance--065b5ad5-023a-5336-b458-e9c9dcda2976","240":"instance--5ea0dd2b-5eac-51f8-855a-4cbcb801bc2d","270":"instance--bba66874-a069-56c6-bb95-967cb3cefc9e","30":"instance--6377c09d-ecb4-5567-a2f4-4dde56ff4f98","300":"instance--ede3430f-b16b-58ae-be71-1d1f1a194336","330":"instance--7772f482-8ee2-569a-b600-7528c065d4e0","60":"instance--98139a98-16b0-54fe-8c77-3473c1b520cd","90":"instance--5cb9cc95-e190-5a68-985d-0a94d39299e6"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--7","properties":[["name","Deploy csvde and AsyncRAT"],["description","On , the actor additionally deployed csvde and the customized variant of AsyncRAT."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1105"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--5150f7cc-6f25-5eb3-a6fc-5099ced4caf4","120":"instance--64a408ce-c543-55d6-a9dd-206ce7cadbb2","150":"instance--1b71e413-cfd2-528c-8792-dc7dd1bb9938","180":"instance--aa12ce11-0165-52b6-b72d-e4d9070e9fbb","210":"instance--5d8b0f08-14bc-58f4-9316-b25a92dd09a6","240":"instance--34f96b84-9453-53f2-ae07-d28c04665e6c","270":"instance--415f1d54-1cd4-5ba7-8071-4aa99bc946ac","30":"instance--18834cac-b4c4-57b0-88ea-5a62fdb27cf9","300":"instance--de4f9957-1ac6-5782-86ea-f1a3b6a9ad13","330":"instance--8eff940b-86bb-556f-8c85-c7c47577b3ed","60":"instance--14a123fd-5626-5e69-8257-6dcd64c28ec0","90":"instance--02294ff1-7261-5db8-8e0d-b9e818922053"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--8","properties":[["name","Deploy second HiddenFace"],["description","On Day 2, MirrorFace was active on both machines. This included deploying more tools. On Machine A, MirrorFace deployed a second instance of HiddenFace."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1105"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--180f2983-9c1a-56f4-99d6-c990125f7baa","120":"instance--c7f65318-7600-57f4-a8ac-992357e695ff","150":"instance--95523e1a-0a1d-52ef-944c-23f9cbc50233","180":"instance--bc8eb48d-411d-5877-aa9b-966476b71207","210":"instance--4cc5026e-07f9-5327-9912-5d278a0a3321","240":"instance--d6a7d51d-39a4-5eb3-8831-f23437781b95","270":"instance--cac30e05-5f01-5b4f-b5c0-6b975297df2d","30":"instance--cb0751b0-c027-5895-a460-a72e48920c71","300":"instance--f41cdc1f-abb7-5ff7-81c2-bf2235a7faab","330":"instance--b114cbda-9ec8-5612-b2f8-93c36811cafb","60":"instance--f28e5296-2041-5fe9-992d-4c70d549191e","90":"instance--3ea39244-da0f-5435-8745-f2afa8b13872"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--9","properties":[["name","Try to maintain persistence with scheduled task"],["description","On , the group deployed AsyncRAT and tried to maintain persistence by registering a scheduled task."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0003","technique":"T1053.005"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--db5fab04-54d4-5eec-a429-185861eb2719","120":"instance--985391bd-d017-5935-ab31-3b4b56331b02","150":"instance--092bb98d-fc30-5f69-b6b7-e3024f3ec65a","180":"instance--755129e6-612e-5b63-a780-1c886d98909b","210":"instance--431723d9-dd8c-5190-9dab-6f346173c044","240":"instance--5b9fb821-54fe-5f22-bba3-038263245910","270":"instance--3c6777cb-6430-544b-b31a-01b198524553","30":"instance--c070071b-a9a3-52fe-8956-a51744db200b","300":"instance--a9a4289c-d995-5783-9544-a8b45052eb56","330":"instance--344009cc-e024-5c68-9246-51e85e00d45c","60":"instance--86c77621-2c1d-59c3-b398-e62f4b48a3dd","90":"instance--67627b08-1913-5f3d-8318-52d3bda9c1c3"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--10","properties":[["name","Execute VS Code tunnel HiddenFace AsyncRAT frp and Rubeus"],["description","On , VS Code\u2019s remote tunnel, HiddenFace, and AsyncRAT were executed. Besides these, MirrorFace also deployed and executed frp and Rubeus via HiddenFace. This is the last day on which we observed any MirrorFace activity on ."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1219"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--6b7baffd-afaf-5472-9af2-a263119a77ef","120":"instance--83f38e63-e29a-53f4-99d9-927a195c453f","150":"instance--3e720145-b7a1-5bd6-8a7d-bb13519675d1","180":"instance--bdce060f-d96c-5b06-b8f4-1ab1527fd01d","210":"instance--a4feb251-e6e3-5680-a712-d59c92f73ccf","240":"instance--9a564ca6-b753-5b06-880c-b3aac25c1e73","270":"instance--76861a89-f006-5e0d-8c5b-ebdcb5e926dc","30":"instance--cf41e64d-4a4b-58d9-9962-72d278b2c489","300":"instance--ac1d6edd-482f-5f13-9348-b605afcc260c","330":"instance--ed78dfa1-f300-564f-b2cd-6c99552b9a68","60":"instance--979accb3-1b3e-5af4-9182-78392cbaf904","90":"instance--ae721c42-320e-5ea4-9c77-339a05b6e12f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--11","properties":[["name","Export Chrome web data"],["description","On Monday, September 2 , 2024, was booted and with it MirrorFace\u2019s activity resumed as well. The main event of Day 6 was that the group exported Google Chrome\u2019s web data such as contact information, keywords, autofill data, and stored credit card information into a SQLite database file. We were unable to determine how MirrorFace exported the data, and whether or how the data was exfiltrated."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0007","technique":"T1217"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","This first email was harmless, but once the target responded, MirrorFace operators sent an email message with a malicious OneDrive link leading to a ZIP archive with a LNK file disguised as a Word document named ."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--2ff8b105-17d8-5bc8-9736-a71ca9281068","120":"instance--fe9b11f7-9a07-51c8-93b2-02f34148833b","150":"instance--15f0676c-2f2f-58cf-99a3-b5eade2d286e","180":"instance--cdc5e3d9-a0b4-5995-98a3-d1a29532ffb1","210":"instance--75ed5df8-ff2f-5667-9748-b8587a1ee318","30":"instance--46009917-4258-54e5-9e91-c46c4a45d34d","330":"instance--54845373-a5f0-5af0-b348-5b0a3b4fbe67","60":"instance--f1f8d9a5-1f2a-55c4-af9a-f2629bc0827a","90":"instance--ddfb6e54-4af9-5771-910f-b4c7ba6e9860","branch:False":"instance--64607b7d-a4bd-56e7-9116-7bc21201